<!DOCTYPE html><html id="facebook" class="_9dls __fb-light-mode" lang="en" dir="ltr" translate="yes"><head><link data-default-icon="https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/rsrc.php/y1/r/ay1hV6OlegS.ico" data-badged-icon="https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/rsrc.php/yD/r/UJj0tgk-RrT.ico" rel="shortcut icon" href="https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/rsrc.php/y1/r/ay1hV6OlegS.ico" /><meta name="bingbot" content="noarchive" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,maximum-scale=2,shrink-to-fit=no" /><meta property="al:android:app_name" content="Facebook" /><meta property="al:android:package" content="com.facebook.katana" /><meta property="al:android:url" content="fb://group/2591141131128917" /><meta property="al:ios:app_name" content="Facebook" /><meta property="al:ios:app_store_id" content="284882215" /><meta property="al:ios:url" content="fb://group/?id=2591141131128917" /><meta name="apple-itunes-app" content="app-id=284882215, app-argument=fb://group/?id=2591141131128917" /><meta name="application-name" content="Facebook Groups" /><meta name="application-url" content="https://www.facebook.com/groups/" /><link rel="canonical" href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/2591141131128917/" /><meta name="description" content="A Facebook group for people to discuss everything and anything specifically going on in Elmwood Park. This page is for residents discuss schools, news, problems, shopping, events, sports and everything else local to Elmwood Park. Post your photos from major events, talk to your neighbors, ask help, answer trivia questions, meet new people and generally just enjoy! Please review our rules: 

Posts
Please keep posts relevant to Elmwood Park.
Posts that are very general and not specific to Elmwood Park don&#x2019;t belong on this page. Please share them on your personal FB page instead.

No advertising or spamming
No advertising or spamming is allowed in the group. Violators may be given a warning and their post immediately deleted. If a repeat offense occurs, they will be removed &amp; may be banned from the group.

No Public Bashing 
If people ask for recommendations please feel free to share yours and move along. Don&#x2019;t bash other business in the thread. Do not post a complaint about a restaurant, grocery store, etc in this group. Save it for yelp, where the business has a chance to respond to the criticism. 

Be Kind 
To protect the enjoyment of this group, we have a ZERO TOLERANCE policy for any racist, ethnic, religious, or personal slams or slurs, and anyone in violation will be removed immediately. 

No For-Sale Posts 
Do not post your personal items for sale. We are not a garage sale group.

Local Politics Only 
Posts regarding local Elmwood Park ejections, candidates and races are allowed. Please do not post about politics broader than that.

Post removal 
If your post is removed, please refer to the rules. Most likely, you broke one or more of them. If you continually break the rules, you will be removed from the group. Consider this your warning.

Contacting an admin
Please send a message to Michael Catucci on Facebook. An admin will respond to you as soon as possible. Please do not message individuals who are listed as admins or moderators. " /><link rel="alternate" media="only screen and (max-width: 640px)" href="https://m.facebook.com/groups/2591141131128917/" /><link rel="alternate" media="handheld" href="https://m.facebook.com/groups/2591141131128917/" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://graph.facebook.com/v22.0/oembed_group?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Fgroups%2F2591141131128917%2F" title="What&#x2019;s Happening In Elmwood Park, IL? | Facebook" type="application/json+oembed" /><meta property="og:type" content="video.other" /><meta property="og:title" content="What&#x2019;s Happening In Elmwood Park, IL? | Facebook" /><meta property="og:description" content="A Facebook group for people to discuss everything and anything specifically going on in Elmwood Park. This page is for residents discuss schools, news, problems, shopping, events, sports and..." /><meta property="og:url" content="https://www.facebook.com/groups/2591141131128917/" /><meta property="og:image:alt" content="What&#x2019;s Happening In Elmwood Park, IL? | Facebook" /><meta property="og:image" content="https://scontent-ord5-3.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t1.6435-9/81717505_2350242638414838_7007673446222004224_n.jpg?cstp=mx770x400&amp;ctp=s770x400&amp;_nc_cat=100&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=0b1479&amp;_nc_ohc=hjrsXvZUdYkQ7kNvwGbuvIK&amp;_nc_oc=AdlJIUkWwXKRfsMF4mtr8he7eTo-qlZ6-Uc3FqXMtOiek25YLg33R34UQPAnCTl0g5g&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.xx&amp;_nc_gid=u050VOY5kca6hfG-hjRMqQ&amp;oh=00_AfHK63XwLTkI9kGIqdmnHLOPfFfuBxTWW0H-TAbC_mzk0w&amp;oe=6839CEC7" /><meta property="og:locale" content="en_US" /><meta name="referrer" content="origin-when-crossorigin" id="meta_referrer" /><meta name="robots" content="noodp,noydir" /><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary" /><meta name="twitter:title" content="What&#x2019;s Happening In Elmwood Park, IL? | Facebook" /><met